[h1]Life Framework: Everon 1989[/h1]

DRAFT, not yet signed off.

This is a content pack for [b]Life Framework (Core)[/b], an open-source roleplay framework for Arma Reforger. The core decides what the game can do: jobs, money, police, crime, vehicles. This pack decides what the server is: a village on Everon in 1989, its names, its prices and wages, and its period look.

[h2]What the pack holds[/h2]
[list]
[*]The village: world layout, place names and signs.
[*]Prices, wages, fines and timers, as config values that override the core defaults.
[*]Period vehicles and period props.
[*]The mission and faction names.
[/list]
The pack has no script. All behaviour comes from the core.

[h2]Requirements[/h2]
[list]
[*]Life Framework (Core), version 0.1.0 or later. Subscribing to this item pulls it in.
[*]Arma Reforger.
[/list]

[h2]Status[/h2]
Unfinished. Content moves into this pack from the core in stages, so what is here changes between versions.

